  <h2>The Power of Texture: Why Choose Embossed Logos?</h2>
  <p>In the competitive world of B2B activewear, standing out requires more than just a great fit—it requires unique branding details that speak to quality. <strong>3D Embossed Logos</strong> (凹凸印花) have become a favorite for premium streetwear and fitness brands, particularly when working with heavier fabrics like fleece and French Terry used in hoodies and sweatshirts.</p>
  
